{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_06",
  "title": "Seafood Platter",
  "storyCode": "DT-6",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3be4b888e032a6d0bbd35810451a32102f55c7fc299ac64086e2ad0f7d0eafd7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh? That noise..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I presumed they would have exercised more caution... Who would have thought they had such confidence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heheh. No matter. The outcome will be the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The church has need of men."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Become one of us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then we shall bring revelation to all Iberians."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That should be the trap set."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just need to wait for them to get enough ingredients and get out of there. Should be enough to buy them some time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Man, Laios, sometimes you really do think of everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's a treasure chest doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let me guess, this world has mimics too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This one's barely even trying."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's a beach! There's nothing here but sand! Who does it think it's trying to fool?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmm? Footsteps... I bet it's that weird guy."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They will become our brethren. Soon, soon, they will become something greater..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tch, it's him, alright. I knew he was sending us to our deaths."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've got an idea."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When the Inquisition comes, they too may have a taste."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A taste of what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why... Why haven't you gone inside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not much of a fighter myself, so I'm waiting outside."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Is that so?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You mentioned the Inquisition. Who're they?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Our common enemy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, mind telling me more?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(It seems this Durin has no talent for combat. I suppose there's no harm in chatting with him.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(With his build, where could he even run off to?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I do not mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We might be seen talking here. How about we go chat by that chest?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Very well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chest?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let us begin with how the Inquisition have been fooling the people of Iberia—eh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Slams open) (Devours whole) (Clamps shut) (Sways contently)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You might call them your brethren, but you don't know the first thing about these monsters."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When you're in a party like ours, that'll cost you dearly."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*phew* That's all of them handled!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I thought there'd be a lot more."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If they were living alongside the kraken, most probably fled when it died."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The ones who killed it in the first place must have exquisite taste..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Think these monsters are edible, Senshi?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, I'm certainly not eating any! They're disgusting!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I think as long as we handle them carefully, we can turn them into healthy, delicious meals!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're not that far from the city though, or particularly hidden. There's no reason the locals wouldn't know of this place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If they won't eat any of this stuff, surely that means none of it's edible?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That mysterious priest must have sent us here to die!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not necessarily."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "These are monsters, after all. We didn't see any weapons in town, so maybe they <i>can't</i> hunt here, not that they won't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Seafood's a good source of protein. If we can make a proper meal out of them, I'm sure it'll be filling."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "NonononoNO!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's nothing wrong with it, the way I see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I might not have cooked a kraken before, but I know how to handle fish, shellfish, prawns, and octopus."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just a reminder that we don't have anything else to eat anyway. Other than whatever washes up on the beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know, okay?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This one's got a transparent head full of... some sort of sticky liquid? It surrounds the organs and this yellow thing..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Definitely can't eat the organs. Let's have a look at that yellow stuff and the liquid..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Really reminds me of an egg."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll try beating it in a bowl later."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Looks like the inside of an egg to me too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You two do realize we're in the middle of taking care of the monsters, right? Can you save the cooking talk for later?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't say that! This is the best way to research monsters in general."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have you noticed how you've already helped us cook these sea anemone monsters, Marcille?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, you're right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I think it's a bit burnt after getting hit by explosion magic."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then there's this strange seagrass. It just withered up in the fire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's probably inedible, right? How about we hold off on trying it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I think you kept the heat just right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Doesn't seem like there's any more coming out from deeper in. Guessing they're afraid of us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I think we've gathered enough monster parts for a feast. Let's go."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh. Chilchuck, why's there a treasure chest next to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And that man out cold over there... Is that the priest?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yep. Thought he could talk us into walking to our deaths, so I decided I'd use this chest to teach him a lesson."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait, he was lying to us? We really did manage to get lots of seafood there, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And did you just say 'this guy'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah. *sigh* I figured this world was going to have mimics, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chest?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Slams open) (Slapped by Chilchuck) (Unable to reach anything) (Shakes angrily)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Seems you've got it under control."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, it's pretty crappy at hiding itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anyway, I assume you're going to want to see what this world's mimics taste like, so here, take it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wow, really?! You're the best!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Whispers) Does this count as playing nice with him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Whispers) Probably."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Whispers) You're a good egg, lad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Whispers) Shut up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "C'mon, let's go start a fire on the beach!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's start by opening up this one that looks like a sea anemone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I was thinking earlier... It should be here... Yep, there it is! Its head is on the bottom."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Eh? That flower organ on the top isn't its head?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's cut it open and get a better look. The head's structured a lot like a starfish..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Peel back its skin a bit..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
