    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Anita finally reaches the shore, but it seems she is too late.\nUpon a beach fallen into silence, people have gathered for the first time in a long while.\nA group of four have rolled up their trousers and waded into the sea in high spirits, breaking out into laughter on occasion."
